      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This makes sense. It's probably best and easier to just force use what ever version it is when you join a friend's instance or a public instance that was running for a long while.\nWhile making a new instance automatically uses the newest version available.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
